+    results/outer_loop_round11_bp35_probe_20260712.json): first attempt
+    at fresh L7 territory. L7 DOUBLES the per-level hard action-count
+    budget from L6''s 64 actions to 128 -- do not assume the timer
+    stays at 64 for future levels; verify it live each time via a
+    grounded reading of the executable timer branch, as this session
+    did (using an early ACTION5 no-op to advance the timer/HUD while
+    leaving the world unchanged, confirming the exact budget without
+    burning real moves). L7 is a deliberate TEMPORARY-SUPPORT puzzle:
